// NEW FLAT catalog table (v27.11) — built + verified live 2026-07-19 via
// docs/prompts/drafts/build-sku-master-v2-2026-07-19.sql (1,743 rows poured
// from mo_sku_lookup_v2; 25 retired TOOLS 645xxxx rows marked isActive=false).
//
// Shaped like mo_sku_lookup_v2 above, deliberately FLAT — no FKs, no helper
// tables. Intended to replace the old normalised `sku_master` (+ its
// product_category / product_name / base_colour helpers) in a later session.
//
// Column names match the live table exactly → no @map / @@map anywhere.
// Both timestamps are timestamptz in the DDL — @db.Timestamptz(6) is required
// or Prisma would emit plain `timestamp` and mismatch the live column.
//
// Two flags, deliberately separate (they answer different questions):
//   isPrimary = duplicate-twin flag (carried from mo_sku_lookup_v2)
